:'''Black Swan:''' Are you ready? Don't be too surprised.
----
:'''Acheron:''' Is that... Firefly?
:'''Black Swan:''' Yes. It's what this room left behind &mdash; the memories of her. The slight trembling of the ground, the fleeting reflections on the screen, the flow of memoria... I gathered and reproduced them in fragments.
:'''Black Swan:''' As for the context... we'll need to sort that out a bit. Hurry along now. Recreating memories on this scale takes quite a toll on me.
----
{{Dialogue End}}

