:'''Aventurine:''' Thank you for your efforts, Memokeeper - quite a brilliant move to pit enemies against each other.
:'''Aventurine:''' When I first saw the Ranger and the Hunter together, my heart skipped a beat... I never thought you'd successfully trigger a conflict between the two.
:'''Black Swan:''' As promised, I've delivered the child to you. Our transaction is complete.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What is happening...
::What is happening...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You two are in this together...
::You two are in this together...
::Black Swan, you...
::'''Aventurine:''' Haha, looks like our Nameless friend over here is still confused. Let me explain.
::'''Aventurine:''' In short, you need to thank this lady here, my friend. Not only did she not betray you &mdash; on the contrary, she rescued you...
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Acheron has her peculiarities, but...
:::'''Aventurine:''' But? There's no but. This is the truth.
:::An Emanator? Whose?
:::'''Aventurine:''' Perhaps The Hunt... or Destruction... or even Finality. It doesn't matter, these Paths all point to the same outcome.
:::Impossible. Why should I believe you?
:::No way. Acheron was right there at the scene. It couldn't have been her.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} An Emanator? Whose?
